Product ethics (unchanged by this grant)
----------------------------------------

Inside Dreamberry / Cloudberry as artworks:

  - The Cloudberry archive stays a closed, sacred corpus: do not mix
    generated Dreamberry frames into Cloudberry R2 or present them as
    photographs.
  - Generated frames stay labeled generated in the details drawer, not
    as an overlay on the image.

The CC BY grant is about reuse outside the piece. It does not reopen the
archive product or change labeling honesty.

